    "body": "This is nit-picking, but I feel like “automatically” is not quite the right word here. The UA “reacts” in the case of a picture element, and does not “react” with a media element. Both behaviors are “automatic” in a way. \n\nConsider reversing the order of the picture vs media element descriptions, maybe?\n\nRegardless, this nit need not be picked, and the spec change is great.",
